    "caption": "Who shapes a club’s training?\n\nWeston FC lists Luis Mendoza as Boys Technical Director, directing the technical side of its boys’ programs.\n\nWhen you compare clubs, ask: what will players work on, how do coaches give feedback, and who helps if the group isn’t the right fit?\n\nCoaches and parents: what question would you add?\nhttps://www.westonfc.org/copy-of-admin-staff\n\n#WestonFC #SoccerCoaching #YouthSoccer",
